            description: "Fruit Notes reports Howard, named in the source as Howard (Premier), at 433.50 ounces per plot and 5,996 calculated quarts per acre in 1952. Source treats Howard as the early-berry benchmark and says none of the newer varieties showed promise of replacing it as an early berry"
